  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Transport layer:\n      - Optimized with Lazy-Allocation: ReceiveBuffer is only rented from the pool upon the first byte received, neutralizing \"Zombie Connection\" memory overhead.\n      - Bulletproof Resource Reclamation: Refactored Disconnect/Clear logic ensuring 100% cleanup of buffers, tasks, and CTS to prevent any memory leaks.\n      - High-Performance Generic API: Added Send/SendAsync overloads for ReadOnlySpan<T> (unmanaged types), enabling direct memory transmission without intermediate conversions.\n      - Async Pipeline Enhancement: Optimized ProcessSendLoop with batch-processing (up to 64 messages) for maximum throughput.\n      - Dynamic Capacity Scaling: Upgraded session capacity from static 1,024 to a processor-aware dynamic limit (16,384 per logical core).\n      - Optimized Session Lookup: Implemented Power-of-Two bitwise masking (SessionMask) for near-instant session retrieval, replacing costly modulo operations.\n      - Silent-Defense Integration: Massive connection headroom combined with lazy-allocation effectively neutralizes high-frequency \"Silent Connection\" DDoS attacks.\n      - Adaptive Resource Management: Automatic adjustment of internal structures based on Environment.ProcessorCount for optimal hardware utilization.",
